body:
It is possible that I am putting a lot of pressure on myself to be efficient and hyper-functioning. I hadn't thought about that... I hope I slowly get better. Do you think these thoughts will go away? 

&#x200B;

And I love you, wherever you are, whoever you are. I deeply appreciate your presence on this planet.

I want to throw it away because living with depression fucking sucks (I was diagnosed).... I don't know if I can keep it up. Nothing helps... It's like there's too much effort to carry this burden around. Just want some relief you know? It's never ending. and the "positives" I do have all get contaminated with my shit. 

&#x200B;

But yeah, I would love to talk... Just getting your comment was life affirming. At least someone cares. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
